{"id":"helada","lemma":"helada","pos":"noun","rank":4439,"glosses":["frost, freezing","handcuffs"],"ipa":"/eˈlada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"heladas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-helada.wav","examples":[{"text":"El agua estaba helada.","en":"The water was cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501274","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Me muero por una bebida helada.","en":"I'm dying for a cold drink.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"drink, beverage"},null]},{"text":"Él se tiró agua helada.","en":"He poured cold water over himself.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to drop intentionally","l":"tirar"},{"g":"water"},null]},{"text":"La helada hizo mucho daño a los cultivos.","en":"The frost did a lot of damage to the crops.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"damage"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"crop","l":"cultivo"}]},{"text":"Tom saltó al agua helada.","en":"Tom jumped into the cold water.","words":[null,{"g":"to jump","l":"saltar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"water"},null]}]}